00:31:03.000 --> 00:31:07.410
which is for many years,
over hundreds, thousands,

00:31:07.410 --> 00:31:09.330
tens of thousands of people,

00:31:09.330 --> 00:31:11.100
billions of dollars of investment,

00:31:11.100 --> 00:31:13.410
there's preparation for a rocket launch.

00:31:13.410 --> 00:31:16.950
And when it actually happens
in a matter of seconds,

00:31:16.950 --> 00:31:21.210
the whole thing either blows up, combusts,

00:31:21.210 --> 00:31:24.060
or it has a glorious launch.

00:31:24.060 --> 00:31:28.830
And knowing what level
of preparation is enough

00:31:28.830 --> 00:31:32.160
for the glorious launch is
really interesting in your shoes,

00:31:32.160 --> 00:31:36.630
but waiting too long bears
